  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">IDB/Partnership 2006-2009</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Inter American Development Bank Partnership</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Syftet med Sida / IDB Partnership &#xe4;r att f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra effektiviteten och effekterna av fattigdomsbek&#xe4;mpning genom att identifiera och genomf&#xf6;ra gemensamma aktiviteter p&#xe5; projekt, program och politisk niv&#xe5;. Detta sker genom en fond som f&#xf6;rvaltas av IDB. De projekt som finansieras genom fonden &#xe4;r godk&#xe4;nda gemensamt av Sida och IDB.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The obejctive with the Sida/IDB Partnership is to improve the effectiveness and impact of poverty reduction operations through the identification and implementation of joint activities at project, program and policy levels. This is done through a fund administered by the IDB. The projects to be financed through the fund are also approved jointly by Sida and the IDB.</narrative>
  </description>
